        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 7 x 22 Low Profile Lite Kit with Wire Glass</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor 7\" x 22\" door cutout. Low profile door lite kit with 1/4\" thick safety wire glass and glazing tape. Mitered and welded corners including reinforcing clips. For 1-3/4\" thick, wood or hollow metal doors.  Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1/4\" (7mm) thick fire protective Wire Glass has 3/4\" x 3/4\" diamond pattern electrically welded steel wire mesh and is etched with UL fire rating classification. Maintains integrity when fractured or subjected to a hose stream. Impact Safety Rating Meets ANSI Z97.1 Class C\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nGray primer powder coat finish.  Packaged with #8 x 1-5/8 Phillips head sheet metal screws (SMS).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/5-x-1-2-x-48-saddle-threshold-ngp-425-48\"><b>4 Foot Saddle Threshold</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/5-x-1-2-x-72-saddle-threshold-ngp-425-72\"><b>6 Foot Saddle Threshold</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP L-FRA100-7x22-WG Lite Kit\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Cut Out Width: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cut Out Height: 22\"</li>\r\n<li>Wire Glass Width: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Wire Glass Height: 21\"</li>\r\n<li>Wire Glass Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Frame Projection Off Door: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #8 x 1-5/8 Phillips head SMS</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/L-FRA100_cutsheet.pdf?v=1704262387\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP L-FRA100 Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Wired_Glass_cutsheet.pdf?v=1704262387\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP 1/4\" Wired Glass Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
